fits of Continuous Alumina Fiber<o:p><\/o:p><\/b><\/p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\">At Vulcan Shield Global, we specialize in continuous alumina fibers, which are ideal for extreme high-temperature applications. Our products range from continuous alumina fiber cloths, sleeves, tapes, ropes, and sewing threads, and also short fiber products like needled blankets, paper and raw fiber, engineered to withstand continuous temperatures of up to 1200\u00b0C.<\/p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\">On Day 1 of the JEC Forum Southeast Asia, we had the opportunity to connect with various industry leaders from the petrochemical, automotive, metal, and semiconductor sectors. These conversations provided us with valuable insights into the specific challenges these industries face and how our high-temperature resistant alumina fiber products can address their needs. By understanding the unique requirements of each sector, we are better equipped to offer tailored solutions that enhance performance and safety in the most demanding application<\/p>\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-e312a00 e-con-full e-flex e-con e-parent\" data-id=\"e312a00\" data-element_type=\"container\" data-settings=\"{&quot;content_width&quot;:&quot;full&quot;}\" data-core-v316-plus=\"true\">\n\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-349eebb e-con-full e-flex e-con e-child\" data-id=\"349eebb\" data-element_type=\"container\" data-settings=\"{&quot;content_width&quot;:&quot;full&quot;}\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-acdf2f3 elementor-widget elementor-widget-image\" data-id=\"acdf2f3\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"image.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<img decoding=\"async\" width=\"640\" height=\"640\" src=\"https:\/\/www.vulcanshield.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/06\/JEC-Forum-Bangkok-e1718095975326-1024x1024.jpg\" class=\"attachment